# Syncthing Troubleshooting Checklist

- [ ] Navigate to http://localhost:8384
- [ ] Open 'Actions' (작업) -> 'Logs' (로그)
- [ ] Check logs for errors ('upload2601', 'error', 'failed', 'connection reset', 'timed out')
- [ ] Expand 'Kevincity Share' folder
- [ ] Check for 'Failed Items' (실패한 항목)
- [ ] Report findings
